 "hash": "c90210c96dcb24a3",
 "role": "XCTest suite for EmailContactStore.resolveNames (comma-separated names → recipient addresses for emailed health reports): exact/case-insensitive/whitespace-trimmed matches, unknown names reported, duplicate names reported ambiguous, literal addresses passed through, empty entries dropped, multiple recipients. Also StoredItemDeleteTests: a route or contact delete reports a failed write (read-only folder) and keeps the item, and a successful delete is on disk and drops the set-aside copy. EmailContactReloadTests: a book unreadable at launch is read again before a lookup.",
 "types": [
  "EmailContactResolutionTests: class (XCTestCase, @MainActor)",
  "StoredItemDeleteTests: class (XCTestCase, @MainActor) — verified deletes in SavedRouteStore and EmailContactStore",
